%% Carried forward unchanged from v1.2 — no correction in the v1.3 change list applied to this diagram.

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ATS_Mgmt_Pending: CRM requests ATS Execution Approval

    ATS_Mgmt_Pending --> Customer_Email_Pending: Management Approves\n(Management Approval #2 of 3)
    ATS_Mgmt_Pending --> ATS_Mgmt_Pending: Management Sends Back\n(remark mandatory)

    Customer_Email_Pending --> Legal_Print_Pending: CRM uploads customer approval email PDF

    Legal_Print_Pending --> Legal_Manager_Check: Legal Executive prints ATS,\ncompletes Garvi, enters ref no.

    Legal_Manager_Check --> CFO_Ledger_Check: Legal Manager Approves\n(may be performed by CRM/CFO acting, §66)
    Legal_Manager_Check --> Legal_Print_Pending: Legal Manager Sends Back

    CFO_Ledger_Check --> Customer_Signature_Pending: CFO ticks Ledger Verified
    CFO_Ledger_Check --> Legal_Print_Pending: CFO Sends Back

    Customer_Signature_Pending --> Legal_Final_Verification: CRM obtains physical\ncustomer signature
    note right of Customer_Signature_Pending
        Physical custody log:
        Legal Exec → CRM (draft)
        CRM → Legal Manager (signed, next step)
    end note

    Legal_Final_Verification --> SRO_Registration_Pending: Legal Manager final Approve
    Legal_Final_Verification --> Customer_Signature_Pending: Legal Manager Sends Back

    SRO_Registration_Pending --> Admin_Scan_Pending: Registration no. + date entered\nby Legal Executive

    Admin_Scan_Pending --> Admin_Scan_Pending: Blocked until Sales Close\nConfirmation ticked (§40, §109)
    Admin_Scan_Pending --> CRMExec_Scan_Check: Admin Exec confirms scan +\nAccounts copy + Sales Close

    CRMExec_Scan_Check --> Handover_Pending: CRM Exec marks Scan Verified

    Handover_Pending --> ATS_Completed: Handover date + signed\nreceiving copy uploaded (mandatory, §109)
    ATS_Completed --> [*]: Unit status → ATS_REGISTERED\nSale Deed Mgmt Approval unlocked
